{"id":"n14142-1-7","stage":2,"title":"오락 · 娱乐","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14142-1-7-1","ko":"이번 친구들 모임에서는 어떤 오락이 가장 재미있을까?","zh":"这次朋友聚会玩什么最有意思？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"친구들","meaning":"家伙，小子","explanation":"친구：家伙，小子；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"2","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모임에서는","meaning":"聚会","explanation":"모임：聚会；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"모임","audio":"/audio/2485fc53da01e9d64bb6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61519","senseId":"1","lemma":"모임","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"哪一个","explanation":"어떤：哪一个","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"2","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오락이","meaning":"娱乐","explanation":"오락：娱乐；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"오락","audio":"/audio/42d51f40ffd8dd78e0ca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14142","senseId":"1","lemma":"오락","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가장","meaning":"最","explanation":"가장：最","readings":[{"term":"가장","audio":"/audio/8fd32c9572450a80df7d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26795","senseId":"1","lemma":"가장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"재미있을까?","meaning":"有趣，有意思","explanation":"재미있다：有趣，有意思；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"재미있다","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71212","senseId":"1","lemma":"재미있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","